394
00:20:23,298 --> 00:20:25,133
Oh! Well...

395
00:20:25,167 --> 00:20:27,502
Okay.

396
00:20:27,537 --> 00:20:29,571
Gotta eat, I guess.

397
00:20:31,475 --> 00:20:32,875
<i>And just like that,</i>

